{
  "id": "113",
  "document": "静躁独行.txt",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "113:p0",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "$t1 == '113'?\r\n`",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:27188:27204"
    },
    {
      "id": "113:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:27204:27206"
    },
    {
      "id": "113:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "门被敲了一下。你猛地坐起。你没有听到汽车的声音。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:27206:27232"
    },
    {
      "id": "113:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你一动不动地呆了一会儿，怀疑着你自己。你是幻听了吗？然后，过了几秒，你听到第二声敲门声，比上次更用力些。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:27232:27286"
    },
    {
      "id": "113:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你站起身，过去开了门。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:27286:27299"
    },
    {
      "id": "113:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "一个身穿厚重冬大衣的秃顶男人站在门廊前，双手插在兜里。你不认得他。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:27299:27334"
    },
    {
      "id": "113:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“你好，”他说着，但是没有一点笑容。他从你肩膀上往屋里看去。“茱莉在吗？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:27334:27373"
    },
    {
      "id": "113:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "茱莉，是马克的妻子。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:27373:27385"
    },
    {
      "id": "113:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要询问陌生人是谁，转到 114。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:27385:27403"
    },
    {
      "id": "113:p9",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要告诉他茱莉不在，转到 122。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:27403:27421"
    }
  ]
}
